  "statement": "Let P, n ∈ ℕ, V ⊆ ℝ^P open, X, X₁, X₂ ∈ 𝒟_n(V) (GeometricCurrentOn V n), and R, R₁, R₂ IMReps in V (contract IMRep V n) with R representing X, R₁ representing X₁ and R₂ representing X₂. Suppose X(ω) = X₁(ω) + X₂(ω) for every ω ∈ 𝒟ⁿ(V). Then for every closed set F ⊆ ℝ^P with F ⊆ V, μ_R(F) ≤ μ_{R₁}(F) + μ_{R₂}(F) in [0, ∞], where μ_{R′} := R′.measure = θ′Hⁿ⌞M′ is the weight of an IMRep R′ = (M′, θ′, ξ′) (Hⁿ = μHE[n]).",
